===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}}, from {{etyl|fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|fervor|lang=la||a boiling or raging heat, heat, vehemence, passion}}, from {{term|fervere||to boil, be hot}}; see [[fervent]].

